    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In early June, representatives from the  Higher Education Commission (HEC) , Pakistan and the AKU Network of Quality Assurance and Improvement met in Islamabad, Pakistan. In attendance from HEC were Dr Mohammed Rafiq Baloch, Director General, and Mr Nasir Shah, Director, Quality Assurance, and from AKU Dr Tashmin Khamis, Director, QAI_net, Mr Faisal Notta, Assistant Director, QAI_net, and Ms Nasreen Shaikh, Registrar's Office.",
